Z||000008||007DOUG||02-04-2001||11:47 PM||||We have cars that get 50+mpg NOW. We're still going to run out??? Damn, I give up.<P>Well, better start hoarding gasoline. It may be worth more than gold 20 years from now......just like MadMax. Cool, I want to be a gasoline vigilante.<P>Maybe we could convert some of the underground Y2K shelters into storage facilities for gasoline?<P>Believe VERY LITTLE of what the media tells you.||||reg||13
