Z||000019||olympic||02-10-2001||04:44 AM||||   Yes we will run out of gas in 2022, but only the kind that costs $3/gallon.  There will be plenty of $5, $10, $15 per gallon gas around.  What, you think you or anyone else wont pay that much?  Everyone will just dig a little deeper into their pockets and fork it over.  This last little spike in oil prices was just a test to gauge consumer reactions and we did nothing but mutter under our breath about it.  We aint seen nothing yet. ||||reg||1
